ablished and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Addendum  1 by Atul K Bhan M D   Electronically signed on Wednesday REMOVED_MONTH 13   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 04 19 23PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON  2  RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION  FISH  FOR HER 2 NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast  Left  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    HER 2 neu gene in tumor cells  REMOVED_DATE  Amplified   See note  Note  Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER 2 signals  809  to chromosome 17 signals  99  in 60 tumor cell nuclei  A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis  The results at or near the cutoff point  ranging from REMOVED_DATE   2 2  should be interpreted with caution  Equivocal Amplification   Reference  Journal of Clinical Oncology 25 118 145   REMOVED_CASE_ID   Addendum  2 by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on Thursday REMOVED_MONTH 14   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 01 58 30PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON  3  ADDITIONAL IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY RESULTS BREAST  LEFT  FINAL MARGIN SUPERIOR   EXCISION  NOTE  Additional immunostains performed on block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  show that the foci of carcinoma are negative for vascular markers   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    In conjunction with the morphological findings  these foci of carcinoma are favored to represent residual invasive carcinoma  Addendum  3 by Elena F Brachtel M D   Electronically signed on Thursday REMOVED_MONTH 14   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 02 07 07PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as ma