epresent a continuous lesion  The largest mass measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm  and has a central cavity consistent with a prior biopsy site  This mass is located 1 4cm from the lateral end and 6 0cm from medial end  It is located 0 6cm from the blue inked anterior margin  3 2cm from the yellow inked inferior margin  3 2cm from the green inked superior margin and 2 9cm from the black inked posterior margin  The second mass is located 1 8cm medial to the first  measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  and is located 1 2cm from the nearest margin  which is anterior  0 5cm medial to this lesion is the third mass  which measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm  This mass is located 2 4cm from the medial end  and 0 6cm from the closest anterior margin  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of lateral end   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of mass  1 to closest anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of tissue between mass  1 and mass  2   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  2 in toto to closest anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of tissue between mass  2 and mass  3   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  3 to closest anterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections  superior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections  inferior and posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Medial end  en face  Received fresh  labeled  left axillary contents   is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 7cm fibrofatty soft tissue  which is bisected to reveal 13 candidate lymph nodes  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  The lymph nodes are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   2 intact candidate lymph nodes   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   3 intact candidate lymph nodes   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   3 intact candidate lymph nodes   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   2 candidate lymph nodes  