ent with fat necrosis  The mammary tissue shows focally dense gray white fibrous tissue with no discrete lesions or other gross abnormalities  Representative sections are submitted from superior to inferior as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Stephanie Kuehn  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Christine Garcia M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Christine Garcia M D   Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION , Unchecked.
