TE x 1 0cm previous biopsy cavity containing numerous metal clips  The cavity abuts the overlying cauterized 12 o clock area along the anterior soft tissue margin and comes to 2 5cm from the unremarkable free moving black inked posterior margin  The cavity lining is tan pink to white  smooth glistening with fibrotic borders  The remaining parenchyma is tan yellow to pink fibrofatty and unremarkable with no additional discrete masses or lesions appreciated  Along the periphery  no lymph nodes are appreciated  Also received in the same container  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm aggregate of tan pink wrinkled unremarkable skin  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections  approximately 90   of the cavity to the cauterized anterior aspect   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Overlying closest posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Uninvolved fibrous tissue  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 5cm yellow tan to pink lobulated fibrofatty left breast mastectomy  There is a REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm unremarkable skin ellipse with a REMOVED_DATE x 1 4cm unremarkable nipple  The specimen is inked as follows  anterior blue  posterior black  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a yellow tan to pink lobulated fibrofatty tissue with no mass or lesion grossly identified  Representative sections are submitted from lateral to medial in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in the same container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm aggregate of yellow tan to pink fibrofatty tissue fragments which are serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable fat and fibrous tissue  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gross Dictation by Jennifer Nash  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Jennifer Nash  on REMOVED_DATE Micro Dx Dictation by Melinda J Lerwill M D   on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Melind